     "en": "(additional, not in the textbook) A number line from 0 to 1 can be divided into equal parts.\nDivide it into 2 equal parts. The middle mark is 1/2.\nDivide into 4 equal parts. The marks are 1/4, 2/4, 3/4 and 4/4, which is 1.\n2/4 and 1/2 are at the same place on the line."
